<!DOCTYPE score-partwise PUBLIC "-//Recordare//DTD MusicXML 3.1 Partwise//EN" "http://www.musicxml.org/dtds/partwise.dtd">
<!--
  Fixture F-02 (Plan Part 08): the A minor pentatonic box at the 5th
  fret, WITH tab. Every note names its string and its fret, so the
  engine has no position to choose -- only fingers.

  Expected: fret 5 -> finger 1, fret 7 -> finger 3, fret 8 -> finger 4,
  the hand at position 5 the whole way, and not one shift.

  MusicXML numbers strings from the thin e, this engine from the low E
  [IN-X03], so <string>6</string> below IS the low E: engine string 1.
-->
